# Drop the agent OTA bundle here before a packaging build, for the
# "Provision unit…" feature:  sdr-agent-<version>.tar.gz
# (produced by sdr-agent/deploy/build_bundle.sh). The PyInstaller spec collects
# bundles/sdr-agent-*.tar.gz into the frozen app. The tarballs themselves are
# gitignored (binary, versioned out-of-band); this file just keeps the dir.
